// The OTel monolith (go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/propagators) is capped at
// v0.22.0 and still ships b3, colliding with the split propagators/b3 module
// pulled in by otelecho's tests. The plugin opts out of the tunnel stack
// (-tags no_tunnel), so nothing needs the monolith — exclude it to keep the
// module graph / `go mod tidy` unambiguous.
exclude go.opentelemetry.io/contrib/propagators v0.22.0
